Create singularity images :
- singularity-create-build.sh
- singularity-create-install.sh

Build :
- singularity-build.sh (enter build container)
- debian-build.sh (run from build container); build and create packages

Install : 
- singularity-install.sh (enter install/test container)
- debian-install.sh (run from install/test container); install glgrib-glfw

Test : 
- singularity-test.sh (enter test container)
- debian-test.sh (run from test container); start glgrib-glfw
